5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's get started! I want to make sure we pick a place everyone can actually afford and enjoy. I'll look into the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful start, Mio. I am interested in how we can bring the members closer together, so I will look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for the away camps.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll focus on the logistics and the burden on the organizers. I will check the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to make sure we actually get some sleep this year! I'll check the accounts from the two clubs that went inland and the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll handle the remaining details. I will look into the vacation timetable for the club's own hall and the membership list against first-train times.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,Does anyone else think we should double-check the costs? I'm worried about how we handle the budget if people cancel.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very thoughtful point, Mio. It is important that no one feels burdened by the costs of others. Perhaps the information you find on the quoting terms will give us some clarity.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. We should also consider the administrative effort required for each option, as we cannot afford to burn out the organizers before the camp even begins.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,Exactly! And we can't train if we're exhausted. I'm curious if those public beds are actually comfortable or just cheap.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I think we should prioritize stability. If the local hall is too crowded or the commute is impossible for some, we'll know soon enough.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm glad we're on the same page. I'll make sure to see if there's any pattern in the transport costs that could help us save money.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I hope that by understanding why some members didn't attend in the past, we can choose a destination that makes everyone feel truly welcome and included.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I will keep a close eye on the application process for public facilities; if it's too cumbersome, it might not be a viable option regardless of the cost.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'll be looking for any warnings about the inland centers. If they're too noisy or crowded, we should probably avoid them!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'll just focus on the facts for now. Once we have the data on the hall and the train times, we can see if staying local is even a realistic possibility.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"Alright, I think we've covered everything for now. Let's go gather our information and meet back here to discuss the options!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I look forward to seeing what we discover. Let us all do our best to find the most harmonious solution for the club.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll get to work on my research immediately. Let's reconvene once we have the results.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to find out if we can actually get some peace and quiet this year. See you all soon!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll do the same. Let's meet back here once we've all reviewed our findings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
