60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Now that we've seen the options, I'm leaning toward the Mountain Training Centre. It seems like a safe middle ground for the budget, even if the booking is a bit of a pain.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I am concerned about the Mountain Training Centre; if the rooms are as crowded as Rin feared, we will not achieve the bonding we need. I believe the Coastal Lodge is the best choice for our harmony.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The Coastal Lodge sounds appealing for the meal service, but the non-refundable deposit and fixed headcount are a logistical risk. I cannot support the Mountain Training Centre due to that application process.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'm definitely against the Mountain Training Centre! Eight people to a room is a nightmare. I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge so we can actually get some proper sleep.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"The Coastal Lodge is too risky financially with those non-refundable deposits. Given the hall's schedule and the commute issues, Campus Intensive is the only way to ensure we don't end up in another deficit.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Wait, if we do Campus Intensive, won't we be back to the cooking problem Ryuji mentioned? I'm worried that would just make the organizers miserable again.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very valid concern, Mio. If the organizers are exhausted from cooking, they will have no energy left to help the younger members feel welcome and included.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,Exactly. Campus Intensive means we are back to square one with the canteen closure. I cannot agree to a plan that guarantees organizer burnout.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,And we'd still have the problem of people not being able to get to campus on time! The Coastal Lodge sounds way more like a real vacation where we can actually recover.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"The commute is a problem, but it's a manageable one compared to a financial loss that the club account cannot absorb. We must be responsible with our funds.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I see Misaki's point about the money, but if we choose the Coastal Lodge, can't we just be very strict about the deadline for cancellations to avoid that risk?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"That would be a very sensible approach, Mio. If we can manage the risk together, the opportunity for the members to bond in a shared building is far too precious to pass up.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Even with a strict deadline, the risk of a last-minute emergency remains. However, compared to a nine-page application or hours of cooking, the Coastal Lodge is the most reasonable compromise for the organizers.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm totally on board with that! Let's go to the coast where we can sleep properly and not worry about cooking or filling out endless forms.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I still have strong reservations about the financial risk, but if the rest of you are willing to manage the cancellation policy strictly, I suppose it is better than the other alternatives.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,I'm glad we could find a compromise! I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will also vote for the Coastal Lodge, for the sake of our members' happiness and unity.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge as well; it's the only option that doesn't guarantee a logistical disaster.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,Coastal Lodge all the way! I'm voting for that so we can finally get some real rest.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'll vote for the Coastal Lodge too, provided we are absolutely rigorous about the payment deadlines.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
